(Remarks:
--
==
- 丙辰 Ping-shan: year 53/60 of the [sexagenary cycle]
- 咸豐 H(a/)m-fung: [Emperor Hien-fung] of the Ts(')ing Dynasty
- Fun fact: [咸豐年](/entries/haam#cantonese-咸豐年) is now a Cantonese phrase meaning "ages ago"
==
--
End of remarks.)
